<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab militants attacked near the Kenya-Somalia border, killing eight people in Mandera and also opened fire on road workers in Kenya. Somali security forces fired on protesters in Mogadishu, resulting in three deaths, while the government offered condolences to Egypt after a train collision killed seven. The Federal Government and opposition parties reached a deal to ease the deepening crisis, and troops reported killing 76 al-Shabaab militants in central Somalia. The conflict produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1vckVTSWFfUjlTckdjNWRfNnJpMHJkdzh4aWZic09LQVFGVkNvTXlIbGtCV0x3VnZ1VHJ4VkFQb0k4ekF2OWYxQ0R5anNJdHJGaWtQcVRwYlNSLVJ6VXfSAWNBVV95cUxQcWhseEI5TFM5SlE0cnRLWTNPMTREdUhxdUwzTF9pTHhIY1FVdjBYWmZRcDVwWXVTOGJxd0k2LWduZ3ZRZ1NCaGFuUHpNa25zSWdIVlpuTVVqcGJyY055RDAwQmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQdk1XU216eUFxRzdTN0dUMl9tejJwcEhMMUNaZ0NEUFkybGN4cWQ2blY4VjREakhMVnJhY3hCdUZzdEN3TDV1cENrTmY0Z25TM1NTVHY0Z0VoU2dBV0ZNaGxVUTlsRFRwaTVXM3BFSmhuNnA2LTY0UUV3QVE3V0NOSXZ1TmdXcGYwSkxTSjVaeHY1S21zVW5WU19MOFE5Vmg5dkdUcFZaUXA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;GhanaWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Graphic Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxQalQ0WGNrVjJCT1loUllTajVxLS1yWnJVZHJZeDh6UUc4aS1zb1lHMzJucXFJdmpHZnY2UGtMX1JRMWRGSlpKQ1kwWFEzZ2plVWE5cnp5RHJFREE4X0l0Y3l0MGRZcVlPNDF4aWIxV3BFMElwaWx3M3hzR2FFbTUzeXVhT1ZRVlAySV9US1F5RWthX0VJb0NoOTlTclVWSklMT0dBOS1NcHZmblFRMWpGUWFVV1JPa3Y4SVEwVFYtQXc4U04w?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOUk91eEc5QVd1a0FvbTVUQnh